# 订阅表单：客户端类型（User-Agent）
msgid "Client type"
msgstr "订阅客户端类型"

msgid "Default (not set)"
msgstr "默认（不设置）"

msgid "Custom"
msgstr "自定义"

msgid "Some airports hand out nodes based on the client type: on the same link, only the right type parses into real nodes — the wrong one yields a placeholder node saying your client is incompatible. Keep “Default” if unsure."
msgstr "部分机场按客户端类型下发节点：同一链接只有选对类型才解析得出真实节点，选错会得到「与您使用客户端不兼容」的占位节点。不确定就保持「默认」。"

msgid "“Custom” is for clients the presets do not cover: enter the User-Agent header to send verbatim, in the same shape as the preset values, i.e. client-name/version — for example clash-verge/v2.5.0, v2rayN/7.22.0, mihomo.party/v2.0.0 (clash.meta)."
msgstr "「自定义」用于预设里没有的客户端：填要原样发送的 User-Agent 请求头，格式与预设里的值同形，即 客户端名/版本号 —— 例如 clash-verge/v2.5.0、v2rayN/7.22.0、mihomo.party/v2.0.0 (clash.meta)。"

msgid "Visible characters such as spaces, parentheses, semicolons and underscores are allowed (the whole string is sent verbatim — not parsed or rewritten); control characters such as newlines are not. Maximum length is 256 characters. Set the version to the minimum version the airport accepts; check the airport or client documentation for the exact value."
msgstr "可以含空格、括号、分号、下划线等可见字符（整串原样发送，不解析、不改写）；不能含换行等控制字符，最长 256 字符。版本号填机场要求的最低可用版本，具体填什么以机场或客户端说明为准。"

msgid "Selecting “Custom” but leaving it empty sends no User-Agent (same as “Default”)."
msgstr "选「自定义」但留空 = 不发送 User-Agent（等同「默认」）。"

msgid "Custom User-Agent"
msgstr "自定义 User-Agent"

